Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,早安\N(拍攝一周前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,早安\N早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,請進吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,談一談\N怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我帶了攝影機來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.99,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以拍摄吗\N可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拍攝一下\N在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我穿的是工作服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這是關東煮呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,從現場帶回去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在想拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是EBODY的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,從公司過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,今天怎麼樣\N刚刚拍攝完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要去見人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,製作商要求我來拍攝\N(今天等待拍攝結束的惠美)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,妳刚拍攝結束正要回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我在車裡等妳很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是進行AV拍攝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱了幾次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,三次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今天做了三次嗎\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不錯呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始 一周的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要管理妳的日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經聽經理說了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.07,0:01:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,日程我們包了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這是為了一周後的拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始 咏美休息一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一周後來我們這裡拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前都休息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始休息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎\N是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,理由是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一周後要拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我們有主題
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,妳現在一周拍攝幾天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這個不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.39,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很多次\N不確定是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都做爱兩三次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱次数很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡做爱吧\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也做爱了吧\N(咏美至少兩天拍攝一次)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的次數很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,出道以來一直都是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,出道多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,十個月吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一年嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,過了一年這樣的生活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,兩天一定會做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始一周的時候\N(咏美的拍攝主題是)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,希望妳能禁慾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,(明天開始禁慾一周)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,禁慾一周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始日程不能拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一周的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,禁慾是做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,說實話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,現在沒有男朋友吧\N是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的沒有嗎\N沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟很忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,性伴侶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有拍攝AV的時候才做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣沒關係吧\N(私生活沒有做爱)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,自慰情況呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,經常自慰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很多嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱那麼多了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,多久一次自慰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,三四次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,每週三四次嗎\N不 是每天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都做嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,每天自慰三四次嗎\N是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拍攝後也做嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,拍攝的話是兩次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,次數好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,說了不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這次不行哦\N真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,經理沒和我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,明天開始可以做其他的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很久沒有休息一周了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽說的時候也很驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有性伴侶和男朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,這周休息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,即使有了男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也要禁止做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,自慰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,自慰也是禁止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這是禁慾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是禁止做爱嗎\N(禁止做爱禁止自慰)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一周
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不能做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不能自慰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,禁慾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一周後要來拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在那裡盡情做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(一周後的拍攝請爆發吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一周太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,最渴望的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣才舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼說我就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子一直很飽的話\N吃東西沒味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以等待一周後的拍摄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一周
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,積累妳的性慾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,會變得慾求不滿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我有證據的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這段视頻會進入正片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看的人都知道妳禁慾一周
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.07,0:07:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都看到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妳知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,粉絲們都會看的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,都會看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不是在家裡装攝影機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是妳也不能撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,確實不能夠背叛粉絲們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也會為妳準備一周
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這件事可以保證嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一定會讓妳\N在一周後得到滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這點放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有點困難呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一周的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,妳已經滿足了一年了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,品嚐久違的做爱感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,對著鏡頭宣言吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,請吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我會禁慾一周的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我發誓嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要保證哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,現在回去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止做爱和自慰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,積累性慾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,自己也不能摸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等妳一周
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一周後見
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,保證哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(深田惠关禁慾後失去理性)\N(野獸般的性交)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,(一周後)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幹什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:09:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已經是早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有過這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一周不見了呢\N是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,已經到早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,來了就準備開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在椅子上吧\N开始拍攝了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我幫妳拿包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,請坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 很突然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,已經到早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一周了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,妳休息了一周吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,確實是休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是這個休息也很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,禁慾了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的禁慾了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走路都想高潮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我壓抑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,努力禁慾了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,現在感覺如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,內褲都濕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,內褲已經濕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,很嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一想到就濕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也沒有自慰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有做爱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,當然沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有交男朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,對著鏡頭報告吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,這一周如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,慾求不滿\N(似乎禁慾成功)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真的遵守了約定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼他在櫓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼在櫓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼在櫓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼什麼都不說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一早就這樣誘惑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,禁慾了很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一周的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,成功禁慾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,現在慾求不滿對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,慾求不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好色情哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近一些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼在櫓呢\N不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣當然會在意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟一周不見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一周沒見過肉棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很想做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一周沒有摸了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有摸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,摸摸看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想摸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是拍攝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,這個不會播放
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在意\N可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想摸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,想摸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,儘管摸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很久沒做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣\N一周沒有摸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這個肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐了一周吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在聽我說話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,作為獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想要的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,妳想怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很想插入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,還不能插入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,拍攝的時候\N為什蔭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍攝妳慾求不滿的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,現在不能插入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可以摸的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不能插入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就對著鏡頭吧
