Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下會插入的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這是给妳獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不插入就行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,和他說吧\N可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,想怎麼做\N已經勃起了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,想怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,給妳獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只用嘴舔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,試試這個肉棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很久沒吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,停不下來
