Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.67,0:17:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒的氣味好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這是特別的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可以摸奶頭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,摸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,隨便摸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不能插入嗎\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只可以舔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害\N好色情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好想插入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好想插入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好想插入\N不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓妳滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我們準備了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很久沒吃精液吧
