Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好色情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,變濕了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡變濕了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好濕哦
