Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,給妳獎勵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,想要嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
