Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
